abstract: >-
  An interactive comparison of Argentina at the 2014, 2018 and 2022 FIFA World Cups,
  using a CC BY-SA 4.0 Fjelstul World Cup Database extract as the common backbone and
  StatsBomb Open Data as a labelled event enhancement for 2018 and 2022.
